  "decisions": [
    "All38 CookVI19–21 prompts are retained, including gīet and the exact (om. an)other. adjacency. Their38original companion tasks produce76distinct task/key pairs. The numbered crosswalk is333assigned/311deferred/0excluded.",
    "The exact155-word two-paragraph source begins at Cook145.1 and ends at146.11partial, before the renewed appeal. All21attached notes and their anchors are retained; p144context and p146notes16–19 are not assigned. Printed/PDF/editorial line conventions are explicit.",
    "The source has changes of actor and a syncretic hīe. Active onsęndon is not converted into a passive merely because the Latin was passive. Wæs onweg gewiten is intransitive anterior/result. Note13 is cædunt, not cuncta; the destruction can be translated all they came across. Historical ethnological speculation remains labelled archival apparatus.",
    "The53-word connected new account and12translated examples are new teaching material. Context-dependent examples retain their explicit situations. Actual input and required-output sequences have ordered form/sense bindings and construction scopes.",
    "The complete12-position habban present/preterite indicative construction is distinct from inflectional paradigms; it binds real auxiliary, object and participle records. Reported hæfde uses its actual prior subjunctive identity rather than a synthetic whole-clause record.",
    "Primary BT497a and493a show both uninflected and object-agreeing participles after habban. Selected bare bases are productive; evidenced agreeing alternatives remain defensible. Finite auxiliary subject agreement and participle object agreement are different. No unrestricted causatives, intransitive have-perfects or full new participial adjective systems are assigned.",
    "Wesan+gewiten and wesan+sittende remain recognition constructions. Tense choices depend on viewpoint and context; reports distinguish simultaneous, anterior and intended-later relations without automatic English backshift. Active/passive tasks are agentless and acknowledge information lost; no new fram-agent production is assigned.",
    "Complete62defined inflectional systems contain692cells:36nominal/adjective systems540cells and26verbal systems152cells. Root independently reconstructed all540nominal routes:216literal and324derived from actual same-family models/diagnostics. The designer independently checked all152literal verb coordinates and source rules. Twelve construction positions are excluded from these counts.",
    "Hęre introduces the selected masculine-e pattern with visible expanded variants; sciphęre uses the same within-unit model and has corrected new_class=false metadata. Fōt permits evidenced fōte/fōtas alternatives. Wright202 directly supports fēonda. Īsern adjective is explicitly Cook§57; ēadig retains selected full vowels with optional syncope and endingless alternatives acknowledged.",
    "Actual prior identities and histories are preserved, including supplied geworht, land/fōt/hider/gīet and literal parenthesized participle citations. Productive extensions receive explicit new milestones and contextual descriptions without rewriting old analyses.",
    "Primary BT255b/1060a support new predicative possession;653a supports quantitative indeclinable mā distinct from earlier verbal mā. Lexical government, lethal slēan, objectless seeing, preparation/writing/sending and other new senses are individually taught. Equative swā tokens are distinct from an unrelated hyphenated conjunction.",
    "Provisional independent Cook witnesses remain unchanged; a separate reconciliation corrects lexical choices, the short-i write preterite, accusative fighting/motion frames and intended-later report. Cook79§139 supports locally supplied nolde for the negative reported intention, without introducing a full negative paradigm. Cook20.6repeats gewyrcen: prior dōn+on-accusative placement does not license an unassigned dōn+ābūtan frame.",
    "Root and source editor prepared source-first translation witnesses before other private models. The reserved grammar reviewer has opened no private files but received one proposed21.4clause in a source discussion and promptly disclosed it.75items remain unexposed. A fresh reviewer must freeze an unexposed21.4solution and independently inspect paradigms; both reviews precede exports.",
    "Brief, coverage and this reconciliation must be committed after a Beads export before separate learner/key prose. Complete text review, every-page non-author export proof and register preservation are later gates. No Unit13draft is authorized."
